   191	`gcr.io/kaggle-images/python-tpu`, and staff state that a TPU VM session
   192	carries a null dockerImage on the backend (kaggle-api issue 1197), so the
   193	image is chosen server side from the accelerator rather than pinned by
   194	reference. `TPU_DOCKER_IMAGE` does not occur in this tree's
